Z||000000||87FieroGT||06-20-2000||05:04 PM||||Here are the new pics of my car since I painted it with some pics of the work in progress as well.<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pieces11.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Halfway21.jpg">    <BR>  [IMG] <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Whale21.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Whale21.jpg</A> <BR>[/IMG]<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Rear12_1.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Front2.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sand31.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Decal1.jpg">    <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Open12.jpg">    <BR>Some modifications to come are leather seats, cross drilled rotors, white faced gauges from SuperX, Front Bra, and fog lights which have already been installed.<P><BR>[This message has been edited by 87FieroGT (edited 06-20-2000).]<P>[This message has been edited by 87FieroGT (edited 06-20-2000).]<p>[This message has been edited by 87FieroGT (edited 06-20-2000).]||||reg||10
