Z||000004||Sillhouette.com||06-20-2000||05:16 PM||||RSM is where I got mine.  They can get you either cross drilled or slotted the price is the same if you live in canada it is 370 for four and 260 us dollars for four.  This is for the 84 to 87 fieros.  For the Strange 1988 fiero it is more expensive at 550 dollars now I think that is canadian dollars make sure you ask if you call them.  ph 416-524-4285<P>Cheers||||reg||1
