Z||000007||87FieroGT||06-20-2000||05:32 PM||||Thanks Fret Naught I look forward to it. Check your E-Mail. As far as taking off all the panels from the car it is quite a chore.  But I chose to do it that way to get a better paint job since I was changing to a different color.  You just have to start at it and go until your finished because not every car can be as easily diassembled as the Fiero. Hope I could help.||||reg||1
