Z||000011||87GTBro||06-20-2000||08:37 PM||||The blue GT was OK, but since I helped paint this car and I see it driving around town, I have to say that the yellow is much more aggressive and noticeable.  The car looks twice as good as it did before.<P>The picture of the round exhaust tips don't give them justice.  They really don't look as bad as most ricer's do and they certainly don't sound like them.  They give the exhaust a lower rumble effect.<P>BTW...that's the tail end of my '86.5 GT in the top picture.  We are brothers and we are fieroholics...||||reg||12
