Z||000021||87FieroGT||06-22-2000||12:51 PM||||We both live in the Rio Grande Valley.  It is only about 20 miles north of Mexico on the border.  It gets very hot down here.  Anyway I wish there were more people down here who owned Fieros.  On the rocker panels there are built in plastic tabs that lock into the bottom of the front fenders (1)and (3) that lock into the rear quarter panel.  You have to get a long flat blade and knida pop it out of its home.  Hope this helps.||||reg||1
